        "notes": "The Monastery includes physical violence due to its battle scenes, but these are not shown in a realistic way. A showcase of weapons can also be expected. Among the enemies, there will be zombies and other scary-looking creatures, including huge spiders. Players with arachnophobia might want to take this into consideration. The Monastery does not include nudity or sexual violence of any kind. Alcohol, drugs, and other sorts of narcotics do not appear in the game. It does not contain harsh language either."
